awmaker - Abstracting Window Maker
=================================

This repository is a fork of GNU Window Maker, the window manager for the
X Window System (https://windowmaker.org). The fork is maintained by
Rodolfo García Peñas (kix) <kix@kix.es> with the goal of abstracting the
project away from the X Window System as much as possible.

